    {
      "id": "311-signature",
      "type": "signature311",
      "title": "What each local area calls 3-1-1 about",
      "minTypeTotal": 200,
      "minAreaCount": 20,
      "note": "Each local area is coloured by the kind of 3-1-1 request it makes far more often than the city as a whole, not its most common one. Hover or tap for the single most over-represented request. Requests about people (encampments, welfare checks, needles) are left out. The City’s data covers its 22 local areas, so Stanley Park and the UEL have none.",
